Terminals unused in grammar

    RESERVED
    ARROW


Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE ProgramMembers RBRACE

    2 ProgramMembers: ProgramMembers ProgramMember
    3               | ε

    4 ProgramMember: MethodDecl
    5              | FieldDecl
    6              | SEMICOLON

    7 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    8 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IDENTIFIER FieldDeclTail SEMICOLON
    9          | error SEMICOLON

   10 FieldDeclTail: FieldDeclTail COMMA IDENTIFIER
   11              | ε

   12 Type: BOOL
   13     | INT
   14     | DOUBLE

   15 ParamType: Type
   16          | STRING LSQ RSQ

   17 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamsOpt RPAR
   18             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamsOpt RPAR

   19 FormalParamsOpt: FormalParams
   20                | ε

   21 FormalParams: ParamType IDENTIFIER FormalParamsTail

   22 FormalParamsTail: FormalParamsTail COMMA ParamType IDENTIFIER
   23                 | ε

   24 MethodBody: LBRACE MethodBodyItems RBRACE

   25 MethodBodyItems: MethodBodyItems MethodBodyItem
   26                | ε

   27 MethodBodyItem: VarDecl
   28               | Statement

   29 VarDecl: Type IDENTIFIER VarDeclTail SEMICOLON

   30 VarDeclTail: VarDeclTail COMMA IDENTIFIER
   31            | ε

   32 Statement: MatchedStatement
   33          | UnmatchedStatement

   34 MatchedStatement: LBRACE StatementList RBRACE
   35                 | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement ELSE MatchedStatement
   36                 | WHILE LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement
   37                 | RETURN ExprOpt SEMICOLON
   38                 | MethodInvocation SEMICOLON
   39                 | Assignment SEMICOLON
   40                 | ParseArgs SEMICOLON
   41                 | SEMICOLON
   42                 | PRINT LPAR PrintArg RPAR SEMICOLON
   43                 | error SEMICOLON

   44 UnmatchedStatement: IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR Statement
   45                   | IF LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR MatchedStatement ELSE UnmatchedStatement
   46                   | WHILE LPAR ExprOrAssign RPAR UnmatchedStatement

   47 StatementList: StatementList Statement
   48              | ε

   49 ExprOpt: ExprOrAssign
   50        | ε

   51 PrintArg: ExprOrAssign
   52         | STRLIT

   53 MethodInvocation: IDENTIFIER LPAR ExprListOpt RPAR
   54                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR

   55 ExprListOpt: ExprList
   56            | ε

   57 ExprList: ExprOrAssign
   58         | ExprList COMMA Expr

   59 ExprOrAssign: Expr
   60             | Assignment

   61 Assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN ExprOrAssign

   62 ParseArgs: PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ ExprOrAssign RSQ RPAR
   63          | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   64 Expr: Expr PLUS Expr
   65     | Expr MINUS Expr
   66     | Expr STAR Expr
   67     | Expr DIV Expr
   68     | Expr MOD Expr
   69     | Expr AND Expr
   70     | Expr OR Expr
   71     | Expr XOR Expr
   72     | Expr LSHIFT Expr
   73     | Expr RSHIFT Expr
   74     | Expr EQ Expr
   75     | Expr GE Expr
   76     | Expr GT Expr
   77     | Expr LE Expr
   78     | Expr LT Expr
   79     | Expr NE Expr
   80     | MINUS Expr
   81     | PLUS Expr
   82     | NOT Expr
